      "q": {
        "kind": "text",
        "prompt": "لـ \\(f(x)=x^2+1\\) و\\(x_n=2+\\frac1n\\)، لوين رايحة \\(f(x_n)\\)؟",
        "answer": [
          "5"
        ],
        "hint": "عوّضوا ومرّروا النهاية.",
        "solution": "<div class=\"disp-wrap\"><div class=\"disp\">\\[f(x_n)=\\left(2+\\tfrac1n\\right)^2+1\\to2^2+1=5\\]</div></div>"
      }
